undergraduate got an account and used his full quota-- then the quota
would be too high".  Refuses all requests for increased disk space,
system resources, etc, and pretends a higher authority is behind these
refusals.  Compiles lists of users to watch-- these lists include
users of newsreaders, those who have figured out how to customize
their windows environment, anyone who asks him for increased system
resources, and anyone logged on too often.  Cuts off accounts at the
drop of a hat and claims he does not have the authority to restore
them.  Usually fails to keep the system running smoothly-- anyone who
complains is put on his list.

